WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.701
This is "Late Night".
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:05.400
And now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.534
President Biden spoke today
in Las Vegas about healthcare.

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:11.467
Oh, you mean that place where
everyone smokes indoors,

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:13.667
and it's cool to have
7 A.M. cocktails

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:14.934
as long as you haven't been
to sleep yet?

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:16.067
Yeah.

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:19.567
Sure healthcare in Vegas
is a major priority.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:22.567
After Russian fighter jets
forced down

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:24.868
an unmanned Air Force
surveillance drone yesterday

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:27.601
over the Black Sea,
the White House said Russia's

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:30.834
actions were, quote, "Unsafe,
unprofessional, and reckless."

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:32.901
Well, yeah, I mean, it's Russia,
of course they're reckless.

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:38.567
They think the "Jackass" movies
are meditation videos.

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.901
After the U.S. drone
was forced down yesterday

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:44.033
by a Russian fighter jet,
Russia's ambassador to the U.S.

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.234
denied that
the two aircraft collided.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:49.367
And Putin is claiming the drone
just fell out a window.

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:53.534
In a new interview,
former President Trump

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.601
said that his upcoming book,
"Letters to Trump",

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:57.968
will show readers that he has
had a, quote,

00:00:57.968 --> 00:00:59.434
"very fascinating life".

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.667
Well, the fact that we have to
call that guy former president

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:07.868
shows that all of us have lived
a very fascinating life.

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:09.567
A student at
Princeton University

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.834
was arrested this week for his
alleged participation

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:14.834
in the Capitol attack, which
means even the Capitol Building

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:17.100
is easier to get into
than Harvard.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:22.400
At a rally this week in Iowa,
former President Trump said that

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.400
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
reminds him

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.634
of Utah Senator Mitt Romney,
also Francis

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:29.133
from "Pee-wee's Big Adventure".

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:35.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:38.934
A group of Senate Democrats
called on several retail chains,

00:01:38.934 --> 00:01:41.567
including Costco, to sell
the abortion pill.

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.767
Though, I'm not sure that's
gonna work, because most people

00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:48.534
would rather raise a child than
go to Costco on a Saturday.

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:52.467
According to a new survey,
people who live in rural areas

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:55.067
are more depressed, anxious,
and neurotic

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:56.534
than people who live in cities.

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:59.501
Sounds counterintuitive, but
then again, I've never seen

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:01.267
truck nuts on a yellow cab.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:08.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:11.734
Want to.

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.400
Taco Bell has announced
that next month,

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.267
it'll remove the Quesarito
from its menu in order to

00:02:16.267 --> 00:02:20.667
bring back two popular items --
napkins and the bathroom code.

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:23.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:26.434
And -- There was an "aw"
on the Quesarito comment.

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:27.868
Did you hear?

00:02:27.868 --> 00:02:29.868
What a terrible -- You go to
a show, try to have a laugh,

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:31.868
and then you get terrible news
about the Quesarito.

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:35.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.801
And finally, St. Patrick's Day
is two days away.

00:02:37.801 --> 00:02:39.667
Well, you know what they say,

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:41.701
it's two days from now
somewhere!

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:43.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.234 --> 00:02:44.734
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:45.801
We've got a good show
for you tonight.

